  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-08-08T22:43:37.396Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "They have recently implemented Maximum Avatar Download Size on the client, but this doesn't seem to work at all. Since the only thing it does is hide, but it continues to download it in the background.\nI noticed this because I set my limiter to 15MB and people changed their avatars, the limiter hid them from me, but there was still an increase in ping as if something was downloading and when I unlocked their avatars, I already had them downloaded.\nThen I wanted to check and delete the cache of the vrchat, I set the limiter to 5 MB, and I went with some friends, their avatars were hidden from me but at the time of unlocking them, the avatars were already downloaded.\nSo what the limiter does is only hide them but it keeps downloading them.",
